{"id":"cecotec-langostinos-al-curry-en-ollas-gm","sourceUrl":"https://cecotec.es/recetas/ollas-gm/langostinos-al-curry-en-ollas-gm","publishedAt":"2022-08-18T10:57:46+02:00","name":{"es":"Langostinos al curry","en":"Curried king prawns"},"description":{"es":"","en":""},"appliances":["olla-gm"],"course":"main","tags":["olla-gm","main"],"baseServings":4,"servingsMax":null,"servingsUnit":"comensales","servingsText":"4","minutes":30,"minutesSource":"cecotec","timeBucket":"le30","difficulty":"easy","difficultySource":"estimated","kcalPerServing":null,"photoUrl":"https://ecom-media-manager-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/image/ab3082b5-ae98-4dc0-bf4d-4615683b5d3f.jpg","cookedCount":0,"ingredients":[{"ingredientId":"diente-de-ajo","quantity":2,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"2 dientes de ajo"},{"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"},{"ingredientId":"pimienta","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimienta"},{"ingredientId":"aceite-de-oliva","quantity":25,"unit":"ml","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"25 ml de aceite de oliva"},{"ingredientId":"leche-de-coco","quantity":200,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"200 g de leche de coco"},{"ingredientId":"curry","quantity":0.33,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"1 cucharadita de curry"},{"ingredientId":"cebolla","quantity":100,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"100 g de cebolla"},{"ingredientId":"langostino","quantity":16,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"16 langostinos"},{"ingredientId":"citronela","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Citronela"},{"ingredientId":"cayena","quantity":0.17,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"½ cucharadita de cayena"},{"ingredientId":"tomate-triturado-rallado","quantity":100,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"100 g de tomate triturado rallado"},{"ingredientId":"caldo-de-pescado","quantity":100,"unit":"ml","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"100 ml de caldo de pescado"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Limpiamos los langostinos.","en":"Clean the king prawns."}},{"text":{"es":"Vertemos el aceite de oliva en la cubeta y programamos el menú plancha a 160ºC durante 8 minutos. Cuando alcance la temperatura añadimos los langostinos con una pizca de sal, doramos 2 minutos por cada lado y los retiramos.","en":"Pour the olive oil into the pot and select the \"Plancha\" programme at 160 °C for 8 minutes. When it reaches temperature, add the king prawns with a pinch of salt, brown for 2 minutes on each side and remove."},"timerMinutes":8,"temperatureC":160},{"text":{"es":"Introducimos la cebolla y el ajo picado, el tomate y una pizca de sal.","en":"Add the chopped onion and garlic, the tomato and a pinch of salt."}},{"text":{"es":"Finalizado el menú, programamos el menú fuego lento a 110ºC durante 10 minutos, agregamos la leche de coco, el caldo, los langostinos, el curry, un poco de citronela y una pizca de pimienta.","en":"When the programme ends, select the \"fuego lento\" programme at 110 °C for 10 minutes, add the coconut milk, the stock, the king prawns, the curry, a little lemongrass and a pinch of pepper."},"timerMinutes":10,"temperatureC":110},{"text":{"es":"Dejamos reposar unos minutos antes de servir.","en":"Let it rest a few minutes before serving."}}]}